# A list that a body makes in front of a loop is as its class makes it for as long as the body has handed it to nobody. What is done with it behind the loop says nothing of the turns:
# the method that is read off it in a turn is the member of the class, though operands that may run other code stand between the read and the call, and the push stands in line.
# The results reach a function that nobody has seen, so Link has no word of its own on these lists.
# -- source: a-list-made-in-front-of-a-loop.ts
